    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U01_L04_Q10</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.PF.1</p><p>A quadratic equation has discriminant -9. What type of solutions does it have?</p>]]></text>
